## Travel / mileage policy (EDIT THIS)

> How your practice records the trip and whether travel is reimbursable /
> billable. Drives the `travel` segments and `onsite_hours` on each visit.

- Record `travel`: `depart`, `arrive`, `onsite_start`, `onsite_end`, `return`.
- `onsite_hours` = time between `onsite_start` and `onsite_end`. (default)
- Mileage: not tracked by default.

<!-- Real examples:
- Travel time is billable at half rate; mileage reimbursed at $0.67/mi.
- Record odometer at depart + return; log miles on the visit's notes.
- On-site hours round up to the nearest 0.25h.
-->

