## Billable-hours policy (EDIT THIS)

> What makes a visit billable and how on-site hours become a billable line.
> Feeds `rasa.module.invoices` if it is mounted.

- A visit is `billable: true` when it does customer-paid work. (default)
- The billable line = `onsite_hours` at the account's rate. (default)

<!-- Real examples:
- Only `install` and `support` visits bill; `sales-call` never bills.
- Travel time bills at half the on-site rate.
- If module.invoices is mounted, a completed billable visit's onsite_hours
  + date become the invoice line; note the invoice id back on the visit.
